8. Public t12 Revise-No-Progress Chain

The strengthened public proof executes:
evaluate_fractal_revise_observation_v02
-> validate_fractal_revise_observation_v02
-> evaluate_fractal_runtime_state_transition_v02
-> g2d_t12_validating_to_deadend
