The test does not manually construct TransitionDecisionV01 and does not call a
private Transition Registry seam. The frozen t12 row, public evaluator result,
public queue successor, queue artifact, validation reports, parent references,
and trace relationships are exact.

9. Branch Precedence and Source Qualification

The runtime first rederives and structurally validates the supplied revise
observation through the public evaluator. It requires current VALIDATING state,
the exact D3-local node/cell/source relationship, historical t06 origin replay,
settled observation identity and canonical equality, exact observation,
evidence, advisory, queue-reason, cell/global budget, revision-round, and trace
lineage, plus an exact PASS validation report.

Only the exact profile revise_eligible=false, derived_terminal_state=DEADEND,
and reason_codes=(g2d_no_progress_deadend) sets revise_deadend. That qualified
branch precedes the generic D3-local allowed-outcome selection. A broad
revise_observation-is-not-None shortcut is absent.

10. t07 and Ordinary-Path Preservation

Eligible revise remains g2d_t07_validating_to_revise. The nonexistent literal
g2d_t07_validating_to_ready is absent from the repository. Ordinary D3-local
execution without revise evidence remains g2d_t08_validating_to_completed and
COMPLETED with its prior budget behavior.

Only evaluate_fractal_runtime_state_transition_v02 changed in production.
PARENT_RETURN, FRACTAL_CELL, child-result, activation-gate, POST_VV,
